WEBVTT

00:09.300 --> 00:11.390
<i>When you surpass your limitations,</i>

00:11.470 --> 00:15.810
<i>everything you've built up until now</i>
<i>is reversed.</i>

00:19.770 --> 00:21.230
<i>My origin…</i>

00:23.190 --> 00:25.530
<i>If it was something this simple…</i>

00:27.990 --> 00:31.030
<i>If I had butt heads with everyone</i>
<i>a lot sooner…</i>

00:31.780 --> 00:34.700
<i>I still have things I want to settle</i>
<i>and things I want to say…</i>

00:34.780 --> 00:36.370
<i>I still have more…</i>

00:39.750 --> 00:42.500
Great Glacial Aegir!

00:53.050 --> 00:55.930
ORIGINAL STORY BY KOHEI HORIKOSHI

02:26.100 --> 02:30.070
&lrm;GUNGA MOUNTAIN VILLA

02:30.940 --> 02:33.240
<i>Whether we cry or laugh,</i>

02:33.320 --> 02:35.410
<i>tomorrow will come to us all.</i>

02:36.160 --> 02:37.410
If that's so,

02:38.160 --> 02:40.490
let's laugh, Himiko Toga.

02:42.040 --> 02:45.420
<i>People are living in order to laugh.</i>

02:47.080 --> 02:48.080
<i>Toya…</i>

02:50.300 --> 02:51.880
<i>Were you able to laugh?</i>

03:13.990 --> 03:18.240
Annihilate all Heroes!

03:19.120 --> 03:22.200
This is never ending. Stop right there!

03:24.580 --> 03:26.250
Ryuko!

03:27.000 --> 03:27.870
<i>Oh, no.</i>

03:27.960 --> 03:30.630
<i>If the Earth Flow is hindered,</i>
<i>everything will give way and collapse!</i>

03:31.290 --> 03:32.090
Yawara!

03:33.840 --> 03:36.630
Sad Man's Death Parade!

03:38.510 --> 03:43.100
<i>Toga was multiplying a version of herself</i>
<i>that had transformed into Twice.</i>

03:43.970 --> 03:46.680
<i>Toga's Quirk, Transform,</i>

03:46.770 --> 03:49.480
<i>has a time limit depending</i>
<i>on the amount of blood taken in.</i>

03:50.480 --> 03:54.110
<i>The Heroes have no way of knowing</i>
<i>how much blood</i>

03:54.190 --> 03:56.070
<i>she still has in stock.</i>

03:56.990 --> 03:59.700
<i>But no matter</i>
<i>if they have this information or not,</i>

04:00.200 --> 04:02.620
<i>once the dam breaks,</i>

04:02.700 --> 04:07.040
<i>the overwhelmingly large mob</i>
<i>will encroach on the surrounding area</i>

04:07.120 --> 04:09.420
<i>in no time.</i>

04:14.380 --> 04:16.800
Die, Heroes!

04:21.970 --> 04:26.310
<i>Toya, what happened to you? Did you die?</i>

04:27.640 --> 04:30.600
<i>Did I lose another…</i>

04:33.310 --> 04:34.230
Wait!

04:35.020 --> 04:38.150
Zero Gravity Spacewalk!

04:39.700 --> 04:42.570
I've only known you since last summer,

04:43.070 --> 04:45.870
but my way of thinking has changed a lot!

04:46.540 --> 04:48.410
I told you it's too late.

04:48.500 --> 04:50.540
I'm sorry I'm late.

04:50.620 --> 04:52.670
But I finally found you.

04:53.790 --> 04:55.300
Shut up!

04:56.130 --> 04:57.880
<i>You were crying!</i>

04:58.880 --> 05:02.300
<i>Probably because you can't do</i>
<i>what Twice could've done…</i>

05:03.140 --> 05:04.350
<i>You can't become Twice…</i>

05:05.560 --> 05:06.720
Perhaps Himiko's lack of "love"

05:06.810 --> 05:10.480
<i>for Shigaraki and others is preventing her</i>
<i>from using their Quirks.</i>

05:11.270 --> 05:14.360
<i>That's what Tsuyu had guessed,</i>

05:15.270 --> 05:18.860
<i>but I think I found out the real answer</i>
<i>when I saw Himiko Toga's tears.</i>

05:20.110 --> 05:23.820
Annihilate all Heroes!

05:24.950 --> 05:27.540
There is malice inside of you,

05:27.620 --> 05:30.290
so what you have is no longer
just pure love.

05:35.540 --> 05:38.250
Shut up, Ochaco Uraraka!

05:39.050 --> 05:42.380
You know nothing about me!

05:47.970 --> 05:49.560
Froppy!

05:50.180 --> 05:52.600
<i>The injury I got on Okuto Island</i>

05:53.690 --> 05:55.520
<i>prevented me from dodging that…</i>

05:57.110 --> 06:00.190
You never had to deal
with any inconveniences!

06:00.780 --> 06:03.360
You had no trouble following the rules!

06:03.450 --> 06:05.820
You were born to live life in ease!

06:16.630 --> 06:19.000
She killed the sparrow
and sucked its blood…

06:19.590 --> 06:21.340
And she's smiling?

06:22.760 --> 06:26.220
You've got it all wrong.
It was here on the ground.

06:31.180 --> 06:35.190
Let's reform you to become normal.

06:38.150 --> 06:39.770
Well…

06:40.320 --> 06:43.190
it is perverted behavior commonly seen
in children with strong Quirks.

06:44.200 --> 06:46.030
<i>It's common in this society.</i>

06:46.990 --> 06:48.780
<i>We'll work to right the wrong.</i>

06:50.120 --> 06:51.450
Oh, how silly.

06:52.370 --> 06:53.910
Good boy!

06:57.460 --> 06:59.920
<i>Himiko's face is so scary.</i>

07:00.920 --> 07:03.090
<i>Stop it! What are you doing?</i>

07:03.800 --> 07:05.220
<i>She's a freak!</i>

07:05.720 --> 07:08.300
<i>We have nothing in common.</i>

07:08.800 --> 07:10.350
<i>Act normal!</i>

07:10.430 --> 07:12.680
<i>Why can't you be normal?</i>

07:15.850 --> 07:18.810
<i>Himiko! You sucked your friend's blood?</i>

07:19.310 --> 07:20.610
<i>No, you've got it all wrong.</i>

07:20.690 --> 07:22.900
<i>She was hurt,</i>
<i>so I was just sucking on her wound.</i>

07:23.480 --> 07:26.780
That's not normal!
Don't you want to be a decent person?

07:26.860 --> 07:29.740
Dad, Mom, I don't get it.

07:29.820 --> 07:31.700
I don't get it at all.

07:31.780 --> 07:35.080
Is everyone holding back
from becoming who they want to be?

07:35.160 --> 07:38.670
Why isn't everyone sucking blood?

07:40.960 --> 07:43.920
This is all wrong!
She's rotten to the core!

07:44.010 --> 07:47.340
I gave birth to this inhuman creature!

07:50.010 --> 07:52.930
That's why you put a lid on it.

07:53.600 --> 07:56.520
<i>You suppressed it and created a mask.</i>

07:57.640 --> 08:01.110
You became someone other than yourself.

08:05.940 --> 08:07.610
Uraraka!

08:11.990 --> 08:13.620
Tsuyu!

08:13.700 --> 08:15.580
No, that's not her!

08:19.170 --> 08:20.460
That's Toga!

08:21.130 --> 08:23.500
I will annihilate all Heroes!

08:23.590 --> 08:27.050
The doubles took in the spattered blood!

08:27.130 --> 08:30.010
Annihilate all Heroes!

08:30.720 --> 08:32.140
She got my blood too.

08:33.010 --> 08:35.060
In order to fight against this mob,

08:35.140 --> 08:38.430
it was essential to have
the team working together as one!

08:38.940 --> 08:42.100
But now that she's scattering
and tricking us, we can't…

08:42.860 --> 08:45.940
Kill her! This instant!

08:46.530 --> 08:49.030
<i>There's no way of stopping her now…</i>

08:54.660 --> 08:56.080
Annihilate!

08:56.950 --> 09:00.960
Himiko Toga! Listen to me.

09:01.040 --> 09:04.630
I always thought that following the rules

09:04.710 --> 09:06.710
is what made someone a Hero.

09:07.300 --> 09:10.720
I thought that breaking the rules
is what made someone a Villain.

09:11.470 --> 09:13.640
But you know what, Himiko Toga?

09:14.220 --> 09:18.520
<i>Right now, my friend</i>
<i>is forgoing all the rules</i>

09:18.600 --> 09:21.310
<i>in order to face you eye to eye.</i>

09:21.390 --> 09:24.480
What she's trying to do
is not about annihilating

09:24.560 --> 09:26.480
or about capturing…

09:26.570 --> 09:28.280
It's a lot more difficult than that!

09:28.360 --> 09:31.450
Please give Ochaco a chance.

09:31.530 --> 09:33.740
It might be a little late,

09:34.320 --> 09:38.080
but please listen to what she has to say.

09:58.010 --> 09:59.930
URARAKA OCHACO

10:04.270 --> 10:06.230
We're different from the core.

10:06.310 --> 10:09.280
You guys talk about blessings
and happiness,

10:09.360 --> 10:11.900
but I don't feel any of that!

10:13.490 --> 10:15.110
Don't judge me by your rules

10:15.200 --> 10:18.830
and assume I'm a pitiful person!

10:21.160 --> 10:25.540
By the way Toga, you're not going
to get yourself a Villain name?

10:25.630 --> 10:27.040
He's right.

10:27.130 --> 10:29.630
You and our boss are the only ones

10:29.710 --> 10:31.340
without a Villain name.

10:31.420 --> 10:33.840
Let's make one for you! No way!

10:33.920 --> 10:35.130
No, thanks.

10:35.220 --> 10:37.300
A Villain name will add some credibility.

10:37.390 --> 10:38.970
Vampiress Carmilla.

10:39.060 --> 10:41.600
-Suck-suck. Blood Sucker.
-No!

10:41.680 --> 10:43.310
How lame.

10:43.390 --> 10:46.150
It's just a practice carried over
from before the Quirk Registration System.

10:46.230 --> 10:47.940
It's just to please the crowd.

10:48.020 --> 10:49.900
Funny to hear you say that, Dabi.

10:49.980 --> 10:52.900
I still don't know your real name.

10:53.490 --> 10:57.570
There used to be no difference
between Heroes and Villains.

10:58.700 --> 11:00.370
According to one theory,

11:00.450 --> 11:04.830
it all started when a tentative name
was given to an unknown enemy.

11:04.910 --> 11:09.750
From there, people started using nicknames
to hide their true identities.

11:10.590 --> 11:13.510
A new identity that was assumed
in order to survive

11:13.590 --> 11:16.930
somehow turned into
some code names like in comic books.

11:17.010 --> 11:20.260
Some say this world became a comic book
when people started using aliases.

11:21.560 --> 11:24.980
I don't need one.
Although I think it's cool to have one.

11:28.060 --> 11:29.020
Yipee.

11:30.480 --> 11:32.570
This is why I joined The League.

11:33.480 --> 11:35.400
It's hard to live this life.

11:37.110 --> 11:40.740
I'm going to live as Himiko Toga.

11:42.410 --> 11:43.870
Don't pity me!

11:44.870 --> 11:47.870
It's not pity!

11:50.130 --> 11:51.500
<i>She touched me.</i>

11:53.000 --> 11:55.970
<i>But I'm in no danger</i>
<i>even if she were to float me in the air.</i>

11:56.840 --> 11:59.470
You try to make everything
sound so good and pleasant,

11:59.550 --> 12:02.140
but in the end,
you'll imprison and execute me.

12:03.100 --> 12:05.600
Or you'll just kill me like you guys did

12:06.390 --> 12:07.890
<i>with Jin.</i>

12:08.890 --> 12:11.770
Win or lose. Live or die.

12:11.860 --> 12:15.070
This is an all-out battle for survival!

12:18.150 --> 12:22.490
That's true for the both of us.

12:23.990 --> 12:26.950
If you say that it's not pity,
then it's just your ego!

12:28.040 --> 12:29.960
If that can be said for the both of us…

12:31.210 --> 12:33.210
Then die, Hero.

12:35.170 --> 12:38.380
<i>Enjoy these legions of clones.</i>

12:39.930 --> 12:42.470
Sad Man's Legion.

13:06.870 --> 13:08.080
This…

13:09.290 --> 13:11.210
this is unprecedented.

13:12.250 --> 13:14.420
"Quirks will get stronger
with every generation."

13:14.920 --> 13:17.510
"It will become uncontrollable."

13:18.340 --> 13:21.590
It's the Doomsday Theory
that has been repeated

13:21.680 --> 13:23.220
countless times for many years.

13:24.640 --> 13:28.020
Today is the day.
It's all happening today.

13:29.270 --> 13:32.940
One girl's emotion may change

13:33.690 --> 13:35.360
the entire world.

13:35.860 --> 13:38.110
Crush her!

13:40.650 --> 13:43.780
Gunhead Martial Arts!

13:49.370 --> 13:52.870
She's making us float.
That causes us no damage.

13:52.960 --> 13:54.170
That's right.

13:55.880 --> 13:57.800
Zero Gravity

13:57.880 --> 14:01.970
is not a power used to hurt people!

14:05.470 --> 14:06.470
I won't

14:07.100 --> 14:09.970
feel happiness by dropping someone
to the ground.

14:13.600 --> 14:16.520
If you say that it's not pity,
then it's just your ego!

14:17.940 --> 14:19.570
You may be right.

14:20.070 --> 14:22.240
I can't overlook the fact

14:22.320 --> 14:24.530
that you intentionally killed people.

14:25.360 --> 14:28.160
But when I saw your face,

14:28.240 --> 14:31.830
I thought that there might be a reason
that led you to act that way.

14:33.120 --> 14:36.540
<i>On that day, when the entire world</i>
<i>turned into a mess,</i>

14:36.630 --> 14:39.630
<i>my words caused you to look so sad.</i>

14:40.710 --> 14:42.130
That's your true identity!

14:42.210 --> 14:43.920
That's a part of me too!

14:44.760 --> 14:46.590
Listen to me, Himiko Toga!

14:47.470 --> 14:49.890
<i>When I met you for the first time,</i>
<i>I was scared</i>

14:50.470 --> 14:52.220
<i>because I couldn't understand you.</i>

14:52.310 --> 14:54.600
<i>I couldn't understand how you could</i>

14:54.690 --> 14:58.110
<i>smile so genuinely in that situation!</i>

14:59.610 --> 15:00.610
Shut up.

15:02.150 --> 15:05.030
You're going to live as Himiko Toga, huh?

15:05.110 --> 15:09.370
Then kill all you want
and become whoever you want to be.

15:11.160 --> 15:12.830
Don't make that face!

15:12.910 --> 15:15.710
Die! Why won't you die?

15:15.790 --> 15:18.210
I know I pushed you away once…

15:18.920 --> 15:22.250
And I know this world may not be a place
where you can be comfortable…

15:23.210 --> 15:24.170
It's just your ego!

15:25.380 --> 15:28.840
<i>I know that. But I…</i>

15:29.970 --> 15:31.850
<i>I have seen</i>

15:32.430 --> 15:34.770
<i>so many happy faces.</i>

15:44.990 --> 15:46.030
I like you

15:46.110 --> 15:47.990
and have ever since I saw you
for the first time.

15:49.870 --> 15:53.370
But when you're expressing your love,

15:53.450 --> 15:55.250
the smile on your face

15:55.830 --> 15:58.920
is so lovely that it makes me jealous.

15:59.630 --> 16:01.500
<i>She's a freak.</i>

16:01.590 --> 16:04.380
I don't want to pretend

16:04.460 --> 16:06.920
like I never saw your smile.

16:20.190 --> 16:22.980
I can't overlook your crimes,

16:23.070 --> 16:25.360
and I can't agree with what you've done.

16:25.440 --> 16:26.860
But

16:26.940 --> 16:28.820
if there's even a little part of you

16:28.900 --> 16:32.200
that will spare me
the time to talk to you…

16:32.280 --> 16:35.120
I'll give you blood
for the rest of my life!

16:35.200 --> 16:38.620
I want to talk about love and romance
with you, Himiko!

16:45.710 --> 16:49.010
I'm floating,
even though Uraraka didn't touch me.

16:50.010 --> 16:53.850
Her Quirk is being transmitted to everyone
who comes into contact with it.

17:02.190 --> 17:04.940
That one girl…

17:06.610 --> 17:07.820
What's happening?

17:10.070 --> 17:11.950
One by one, everyone's floating!

17:12.660 --> 17:15.740
I'll just use Double and increase…

17:18.620 --> 17:19.500
<i>It's the same…</i>

17:20.870 --> 17:22.250
<i>the same as what happened</i>
<i>to me at that time.</i>

17:23.460 --> 17:25.710
<i>Similar to what happened</i>
<i>when I almost died!</i>

17:27.630 --> 17:30.550
-Tora…
-Kamui Woods…

17:30.630 --> 17:32.180
Is it really you?

17:32.260 --> 17:35.470
If I was a fake, I would've vanished
with these wounds by now.

17:36.510 --> 17:38.310
I thought that girl's Quirk

17:38.390 --> 17:40.980
had a limit of three tons or so!

17:41.600 --> 17:45.810
Everyone has powered up
ever since last year's training camp!

17:47.730 --> 17:50.740
<i>My body is getting colder…</i>

17:51.320 --> 17:52.990
<i>But what's more important right now</i>

17:54.820 --> 17:56.620
<i>is that</i>

17:57.120 --> 17:58.370
<i>I just want to touch</i>

18:00.330 --> 18:04.120
<i>the sadness that's inside of you.</i>

18:11.590 --> 18:14.720
I grew up in a poor family,

18:14.800 --> 18:17.010
and my parents were always looking sullen.

18:18.220 --> 18:21.020
I wanted to give them a good life,

18:21.100 --> 18:23.940
and I wanted to see them smile,
so I strived to become a Hero!

18:24.020 --> 18:27.110
But as I got older,

18:27.190 --> 18:30.360
I learned that there are other people
in this world

18:30.440 --> 18:32.280
aside from my parents and our home!

18:33.610 --> 18:37.280
And I came to like Izuku Midoriya,

18:37.370 --> 18:39.280
and now, I want to stop you!

18:39.370 --> 18:41.500
This is who I am!

18:41.580 --> 18:44.670
That's why I'm here right now!

18:47.380 --> 18:50.380
Please share your thoughts with me!

18:53.720 --> 18:57.340
Tell me what's been on your mind!
All of it!

19:23.750 --> 19:26.170
I fall in love very easily.

19:27.710 --> 19:31.710
No matter if they're
animals, Villains, Heroes,

19:31.800 --> 19:35.220
boys, or girls…

19:35.300 --> 19:38.640
Because they have beautiful blood
running through their bodies.

19:42.850 --> 19:45.430
I was told to stop smiling.

19:46.060 --> 19:48.100
It made me jealous.

19:51.690 --> 19:55.360
<i>Izuku reminded me of the guy</i>
<i>I used to like.</i>

19:55.860 --> 19:57.280
<i>His name was Saito.</i>

20:00.410 --> 20:02.910
I couldn't ask him for his blood

20:03.740 --> 20:06.830
because I was afraid he'd tell me
that I was inhuman

20:07.660 --> 20:11.340
and that he wouldn't think I'm cute.

20:12.250 --> 20:14.630
Just like you and Izuku,

20:15.170 --> 20:17.930
he'd tell me to act properly,
and that would be the end of it.

20:19.010 --> 20:21.680
That's why I joined
the League of Villains.

20:22.510 --> 20:25.810
It was a place where I was able to live
as I pleased.

20:30.900 --> 20:33.730
You were sending me signals all this time,

20:34.690 --> 20:36.940
but it took me so long to notice.

20:40.910 --> 20:42.570
<i>My time is up…</i>

20:43.410 --> 20:45.700
<i>Jin's blood is expiring…</i>

20:48.660 --> 20:50.710
<i>Jin is disappearing…</i>

21:01.090 --> 21:02.300
Uraraka…

21:07.060 --> 21:09.430
To tell you the truth,

21:09.520 --> 21:11.650
I also think there's something special

21:11.730 --> 21:13.520
about someone who's ragged
and giving their best.

21:14.610 --> 21:17.690
I can't take the place
of the League of Villains,

21:18.610 --> 21:22.490
but I had to tell you
how lovely your smile is.

21:25.780 --> 21:27.120
Am I…

21:28.540 --> 21:31.670
<i>I love both Izuku and Ochaco, but…</i>

21:33.750 --> 21:34.710
Am I…

21:36.880 --> 21:38.380
cute?

21:40.470 --> 21:42.220
The cutest in the world.

23:22.230 --> 23:23.530
<i>Preview of the next episode.</i>

23:24.190 --> 23:26.110
<i>They're finally meeting face to face,</i>

23:26.910 --> 23:29.280
<i>the Demon King who steals Quirks</i>

23:29.370 --> 23:31.580
<i>and the Quirkless symbol of peace,</i>

23:32.700 --> 23:34.750
<i>All For One and All Might.</i>

23:35.330 --> 23:37.250
<i>It's time for the final battle.</i>

23:38.460 --> 23:40.540
<i>Next episode, "Battle Without a Quirk."</i>

23:41.880 --> 23:44.420
<i>Sadness turns to hatred.</i>

23:44.510 --> 23:46.840
<i>In order to stop that</i>
<i>from spiraling out of control…</i>

23:47.590 --> 23:50.350
<i>Go Beyond. Plus Ultra.</i>
